      "printf",
      "\"Welcome to Romeo and Juliet: Text-Based Adventure Game\\n\"",
      "printf",
      "\"You are Romeo, the son of Montague, and you are in love with Juliet, the daughter of your family's sworn enemy, the Capulets.\\n\"",
      ";",
      "printf",
      "\"You have a letter from Juliet inviting you to meet her in secret.\\n\"",
      ")",
