      ",",
      "\"Yes\"",
      "=",
      "0",
      "printf",
      "\"You arrive at the secret meeting place, but before you can see Juliet, you are confronted by Tybalt, Juliet's cousin and a Capulet.\\n\"",
      "printf",
      "\"He challenges you to a duel. What do you do? (Fight/Run)\\n\"",
